8,Decoding early Nahuatl in song | TPR,https://www.tpr.org/2024-10-31/decoding-early-nahuatl-in-song,"November 6, 2024 - So you can take those things from the original novelty and try to transfer them, just to give the general gist, to recreate a kind of feel that those original songs have. 'Cuicatl' is the Nahuatl word for song, and then when you combine cuicatl with the word for flower, you get 'xochicuicatl...' a term that was used to mean kind of like lyricism or poetry writ large.""","Nahuatl, Highland Puebla",Uto-Aztecan
